{"id": "836965", "revid": "912316", "url": "https://vi.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=836965", "title": "4789 Sprattia", "text": " \n4789 Sprattia (1987 UU2) là một tiểu hành tinh vành đai chính được phát hiện ngày 20 tháng 10 năm 1987 bởi Jeremy B. Tatum và David D. Balam ở Victoria, British Columbia.\nTham khảo.\nThe following citation is from MPC 18465:\n(4789) Sprattia = 1987 UU2\nTênd in honor of Christopher E. Spratt, an active amateur member of\nthe Royal Astronomical Society of Canada for 20 năm, with special\ninterests in comets, minor planets, meteors và variable stars. He has\nwritten numerous articles ngày these subjects, including some ngày Canadian\nmeteorites, in the Journal of the Royal Astronomical Society of Canada, and\nhe has been of much practical help to the astrometric program carried out at\nthe University of Victoria. Spratt maintains a carefully chosen\nrepresentative collection of meteorites và was coordinator for the\nnorthwest North American section of the Amateur Observation Network of the\nInternational Halley Watch. He has contributed more than 32 000\nobservations of long-period và semiregular variable stars và dwarf novae\nto the American Association of Variable Star Observers và in 1976 was the\nmost prolific observer of that year. The Chant Medal of the Royal\nAstronomical Society of Canada was bestowed upon him in 1988. Spratt holds\nan honors diploma in horticulture and, as a professional member of the\ngardening staff ở the University of Victoria, does much to make the\nuniversity a pleasant place in which to work. Citation provided bởi J. B.\nTatum ở the request of the discoverer."}
